        "created_at": "2025-08-20T05:35:29.620113+00:00",
        "notes": "For powers  [Renaissance](item_a460f234-6434-4d47-99f9-d4a0b15cd591) is fun if the team doesn't need me to heal more. If I'm struggling then  [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb) is a bit more consistenty for keeping the team alive without Valk and farming ult.\n\nI get  [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) this round if I can since it's really strong in stats but we're also pistolling to hopefully capitalise on the increased dmg to low health enemies.\n\nIf I don't have enough money or I'm getting destroyed I pick up  [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca) since blue beam is good and I try to use it as much as I can, team wide dmg buff during Valk is also really good. It also gives me a bit of armor which is nice.\n\nMy survivability items if I'm getting focused is  [Caduceus Ex](item_9e7965ea-2abc-44a7-b042-950c6ad2fce7) for safer postioning. This one is also good if I'm not necessarily struggling myself but I have a really aggressive player on my team and I want to be able to help them without sacrificing me own safety. Or I get  [Blessed Boosters](item_957fd380-b7b4-40d4-8333-bb8c535ca931) for extra hp and faster repositioning.",
